 and secure way to unlock the full potential of their assets. The platform combines innovation, yield generation, and robust risk management into a scalable infrastructure that redefines how collateral, liquidity, and asset ownership interact across financial domains.\n\n$FF is the native token that captures the growth of Falcon Finance. As more assets are deposited and USDf adoption expands, $FF becomes the core asset tied to the protocol’s scale and success.\n\nFalcon is building infrastructure designed for trillions in assets. $FF is the way to get exposure to that future."}, "links": {"homepage": ["https://falcon.finance/"], "whitepaper": "https://falcon.finance/whitepaper-v2.pdf", "blockchain_site": ["https://etherscan.io/token/0xFA1C09fC8B491B6A4d3Ff53A10CAd29381b3F949", "https://intel.arkm.com/explorer/token/falcon-finance-ff", "https://ethplorer.io/address/0xFA1C09fC8B491B6A4d3Ff53A10CAd29381b3F949", "https://bscscan.com/token/0xac23b90a79504865d52b49b327328411a23d4db2", "https://binplorer.com/address/0xac23b90a79504865d52b49b327328411a23d4db2"], "official_forum_url": ["https://discord.com/invite/falconfinance", "https://www.linkedin.com/company/falconstable"], "chat_url": [], "announcement_url": [], "snapshot_url": null, "twitter_screen_name": "FalconStable", "facebook_username": "", "bitcointalk_thread_identifier": null, "telegram_channel_identifier": "FalconFinanceTG", "subreddit_url": null, "repos_url": {"github": [], "bitbucket": []}}, "image": {"thumb": "https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/69121/thumb/ff.png?1757573403", "small": "https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/69121/small/ff.png?1757573403", "large": "https://coin-images.coingecko.com/coins/images/69121/large/ff.png?1757573403"}, "country_origin": "", "genesis_date": null, "contract_address": "0xfa1c09fc8b491b6a4d3ff53a10cad29381b3f949", "has_supply_breakdown": true, "sentiment_votes_up_percentage": 100.0, "sentiment_votes_down_percentage": 0.0, "watchlist_portfolio_users": 